This repository is a fork of that work. The following changes were made, as
required by section 4(b) of the License:

  - the subscription to read is selectable instead of always using the first
    one returned by listSubscriptions, and meter details fall back to the
    remaining subscriptions when the selected one has no meter
  - the portal token expiry is compared in milliseconds and a token rejected
    with HTTP 401 is renewed and retried once
  - the polling interval is configurable and defaults to one hour
  - new last_call sensor; last_successful_refresh only advances when a request
    actually returned data
  - the options flow was migrated to OptionsFlowWithReload, fixing a 500 when
    opening it on Home Assistant 2024.11 and newer
  - hacs.json was made valid JSON and the manifest points at this fork

